<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><title>Upgrade Alerts · bitcoin++</title>{{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/login-layout.css?v=4"></head>
<body class="btcpp-login-page alerts-upgrade-page">{{ block "mainnav" . }}{{ end }}
<main class="auth-shell auth-shell--simple"><section class="auth-card">
<header class="auth-card__head"><span class="auth-kicker">bitcoin++ Alerts</span><h1>Upgrade your alerts</h1></header>
<p role="status">{{ .Message }}</p>
<dl class="alerts-upgrade-summary"><div><dt>Paid project subscriptions</dt><dd>{{ .Previous }} → {{ .Desired }}<small>Plus your three free projects</small></dd></div>
<div><dt>Prorated upgrade charge</dt><dd>{{ .Charge }}<small>Through {{ .Period }}</small></dd></div>
<div><dt>Included tax</dt><dd>{{ .Tax }}</dd></div>
<div><dt>New monthly total</dt><dd>{{ .Monthly }}<small>Including applicable tax</small></dd></div></dl>
{{ if .CanConfirm }}<p>Confirming authorizes the prorated charge using your saved payment method. Additional authentication may be required.</p>
<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="confirm">{{ with .Policy }}
<details><summary>Read the Terms of Service · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .TermsText }}</div></details>
<details><summary>Read the Privacy Policy · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .PrivacyText }}</div></details>
<input type="hidden" name="legal_version" value="{{ .Version }}">
<label><input type="checkbox" name="accept_terms" value="yes" required> I agree to these Terms of Service and acknowledge the Privacy Policy.</label>
{{ end }}<button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Confirm upgrade · {{ .Charge }}</button></form>{{ end }}
{{ if .CanPay }}<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="pay"><button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Complete payment with Stripe</button></form>{{ end }}
<p class="alerts-upgrade-links"><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Manage billing</a> · <a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/alerts">My alerts</a></p>
</section></main></body></html>
